    <tr><td class="center">1</td><td>1</td><td>필리핀 등 영어 사용 가능 근로자와 현장 공용 안내를 위한 보조 언어</td><td class="check-cell">□ 확인</td><td class="check-cell">______</td></tr><tr><td class="center">2</td><td>- Today's work</td><td>Welding, cutting, and other hot work</td><td class="check-cell">□ 확인</td><td class="check-cell">______</td></tr><tr><td class="center">3</td><td>- Main hazards for this job</td><td>fire or hot-work hazard, confined-space hazard, heat illness</td><td class="check-cell">□ 확인</td><td class="check-cell">______</td></tr><tr><td class="center">4</td><td>- ⚠️ Warning signs</td><td>🔥 🫁 🌡️. If you see these signs, stop first and ask the supervisor.</td><td class="check-cell">□ 확인</td><td class="check-cell">______</td></tr><tr><td class="center">5</td><td>- Before starting</td><td>Remove combustibles, assign a fire watch, and keep extinguishers ready.</td><td class="check-cell">□ 확인</td><td class="check-cell">______</td></tr><tr><td class="center">6</td><td>2</td><td>Measure oxygen and harmful gas before entry and keep a watcher outside.</td><td class="check-cell">□ 확인</td><td class="check-cell">______</td></tr><tr><td class="center">7</td><td>3</td><td>Take water and rest breaks, and report dizziness immediately.</td><td class="check-cell">□ 확인</td><td class="check-cell">______</td></tr><tr><td class="center">8</td><td>4</td><td>If you do not understand, stop and ask the supervisor to explain again.</td><td class="check-cell">□ 확인</td><td class="check-cell">______</td></tr>
  
